ction.\\\\n\\\\n## Work remaining\\\\n1. Clone engine and hub references; read engine guide and starter.\\\\n2. Implement flow, input, scenes, events, audio, meta, multiplayer, UI.\\\\n3. Build and run deterministic core/browser/hub checks and viewport screenshots.\\\\n4. Exit interview and final self-contained HTML; remove build caches.\\\\n'''); print(json.dumps({'title':title,'slug':slug}))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"{\"title\": \"Wobble Wit\", \"slug\": \"Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-222458\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
