','Solid work. I know solid.','Please rise at your own prescribed pace.','Your balance is doing some extra shifts.','The ring is getting smaller. I have submitted a complaint.','A minute is a long shape.','Breathe while bracing. It is an advanced convenience.','I support you. From this very specific position.','The gazebo believes in you. It has six legs.','Your tenth rep has brought a guest.','A floor greeting. Very courteous.','No need to be made of iron. We have enough.','Take a rest. I will hold the atmosphere.'\n],\n'bounce':[\n'Keep going keep going keep— is that your heartbeat? Mine is just air\"'!'\"','Left right left right lovely feet','The beat is not leaving without us','Circle like you have nowhere urgent to be','Switch\"'! A whole new direction to be optimistic about'\"','Catch left\"'! A gift for your hips'\"','Catch right\"'! It came with no receipt'\"','That ring thinks you are doing wonderfully','Lovely pace mind the crab','The crab has right of way emotionally','Not too fast we are on holiday','Breathe through the stitch it is only visiting','A ribbon\"'! Something else to carry home'\"','The step is very excited to meet your feet','Both feet together a small reunion','You found the zone I knew it was here somewhere','I am mostly air and entirely supportive','The guests are clapping on purpose','Morning air afternoon enthusiasm','Your feet make very good points','A double note twice the opportunity','The boardwalk is our very long dance floor','We are getting somewhere approximately here','A little slower is still going','I cannot stop smiling it is how I was inflated'\n],\n'gull':[\n'That was a dive. I am legally required to say so.','We are not here for form. We are here for splash.','The judges have been fed. Their opinions remain hungry.','Six point five. Seven. See me.','The shell must enter slowly. It has paperwork.','A gate is a suggestion with a penalty.','Stand on the board. It has been informed.','The wind is not an official participant.','Your smoothie has requested shore leave.','An acceptable amount of ocean has moved.','Tuck. The sea recognises a compact application.','The fourth bounce is the departure desk.','A very wet argument. Sustained.','The buoy has observed your absence.','There are no snacks on the course. Officially.','My hat is the source of my authority.','A shell in a pool is a closed case.','The tide will be rising. It has seniority.','Please avoid becoming a second raft.','I award that splash an administrative seven.','The tray has five opportunities for disappointment.','Marjorie is waiting. She has considerable practice.','A no-spill delivery. The sea is filing an appeal.','The channel is long. Your attention should match.','Please return all borrowed water.'\n]}\ntitles=['Human Soup','Acceptable Human','Certified Lean-To','Wobble Enthusiast','Seasoned Tilter','Stillness Intern','Professional Standing Person','Alarmingly Balanced','Licensed Sway Inspector','Assistant Heron','Heron, Acting','Head of Remaining Upright','Deputy Cushion Friend','Senior Breath Holder','Respectable Deck Chair','Recipient of a Small Nod','Tide Pool Associate','Quietly Improving','Almost a Lighthouse','Certified Towel Guest','Junior Gravity Negotiator','Wellness Adjacent','Cautiously Buoyant','Official Ring Bearer','Keeper of Five Smoothies','A Sensible Crab','Guest of the Minute','Unexpectedly Serene','Chair of Standing','Fully Present, Mostly','Mildly Remarkable','Director of Not Falling','Balance, With Distinction','Supremely Unhurried','Lotus Whisperer','A Small Local Legend']\ns=''\nfor name,lines in banks.items():s+=f'[{name}]\\\\nlines = '+json.dumps(lines,ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n\\\\n'\ns+='[awards]\\\\ntitles = '+json.dumps(titles)+'\\\\n';(game/'script.toml').write_text(s)\n# Hand-authored native key poses; the renderer keeps its procedural puppet and clip blending.\nneutral={'hips':[0,0,100],'body':[0,0,0],'chest':[0,0,0],'head':[0,0,0],'armL':[10,10,-95,10,0],'armR':[10,10,-95,10,0],'legL':[0,6,-100,0,0],'legR':[0,6,-100,0,0]}\ndef pose(**kw):return {**copy.deepcopy(neutral),**kw}\nposes={\n'Breath':[pose(),pose(chest=[0,-4,0],armL=[10,18,-90,14,0],armR=[10,18,-90,14,0])],\n'Squat':[pose(),pose(hips=[-22,0,58],body=[0,28,0],head=[0,-22,0],armL=[100,4,10,0,0],armR=[100,4,10,0,0],legL=[55,10,-60,95,0],legR=[55,10,-60,95,0],footL=[-12,0,0],footR=[-12,0,0])],\n'Tree':[pose(armL=[0,40,70,50,0],armR=[0,40,70,50,0],legL=[0,6,-100,0,0],legR=[10,75,-30,110,0],hips=[0,-9,100])]*2,\n'Warrior':[pose(hips=[0,0,72],body=[35,0,0],chest=[-35,-4,0],head=[-30,0,0],armL=[0,100,0,0,0],armR=[0,100,0,0,0],legL=[70,0,-55,95,0],legR=[-85,20,-60,0,0],footR=[10,40,0])]*2,\n'Lighthouse':[pose(hips=[0,0,100],armL=[0,0,100,4,0],armR=[0,60,70,8,0],legR=[-20,0,-95,25,0])]*2,\n'DeckChair':[pose(hips=[-20,0,60],body=[0,60,0],armL=[90,0,0,0,0],armR=[90,0,0,0,0],legL=[70,0,-70,80,0],legR=[70,0,-70,80,0])]*2,\n'Bridge':[pose(hips=[0,0,45],body=[0,-50,0],armL=[-40,30,-70,15,0],armR=[-40,30,-70,15,0],legL=[60,0,-60,80,0],legR=[60,0,-60,80,0])]*2,\n'Seated':[pose(hips=[0,0,26],legL=[90,60,0,90,0],legR=[90,60,0,90,0],head=[0,15,0])]*2,\n'ArmFlail':[pose(armL=[20,90,50,30,0],armR=[50,70,0,45,0]),pose(armL=[60,70,0,45,0],armR=[20,90,50,30,0])],\n'Stumble':[pose(hips=[8,0,80],body=[0,30,18],armL=[80,50,30,20,0],legR=[40,0,-80,40,0]),pose()],\n'StepL':[pose(hips=[0,-8,100],legL=[40,0,-65,50,0],armR=[30,10,-90,45,0]),pose()],\n'StepR':[pose(hips=[0,8,100],legR=[40,0,-65,50,0],armL=[30,10,-90,45,0]),pose()],\n'HipCircle':[pose(hips=[6,-10,94],body=[0,0,10],armL=[0,65,-50,70,0],armR=[0,65,-50,70,0]),pose(hips=[-6,10,94],body=[0,0,-10],armL=[0,65,-50,70,0],armR=[0,65,-50,70,0])],\n'CarryTray':[pose(armL=[60,20,-50,80,0],armR=[60,20,-50,80,0])]*2,\n'Tuck':[pose(hips=[0,0,70],body=[0,35,0],head=[0,15,0],armL=[70,20,-40,95,0],armR=[70,20,-40,95,0],legL=[95,10,-15,130,0],legR=[95,10,-15,130,0])]*2,\n'DiveEntry':[pose(body=[0,180,0],armL=[0,0,100,0,0],armR=[0,0,100,0,0])]*2,\n'Flop':[pose(),pose(hips=[0,0,8],body=[0,90,0],armL=[0,100,0,0,0],armR=[0,100,0,0,0])],\n'Bow':[pose(),pose(body=[0,45,0],head=[0,15,0])],\n'Sleep':[pose(hips=[0,0,25],body=[0,90,0],armL=[0,20,-90,90,0],armR=[0,20,-90,90,0])]*2,\n'Wake':[pose(armL=[0,35,85,10,0],armR=[0,35,85,10,0]),pose()],\n'Sigh':[pose(chest=[0,8,0],head=[0,12,0]),pose()]\n}\nmesh=json.loads((root/'anim/mesh2motion.json').read_text());plank=copy.deepcopy(mesh['clips']['Pushup']['keys'][0]);plank.pop('t',None);poses['Plank']=[plank,plank]\nclips={}\nfor name,keys in poses.items():\n keys=[dict(k,t=float(i))for i,k in enumerate(keys)];clips[name]={'clip':name,'dur':1.0,'loop':name not in ['Squat','Breath','Stumble','Flop','Bow','Wake','Sigh'],'tags':['exercise'],'desc':f'Tippy Cay {name} pose.','keys':keys}\n(root/'anim/fit.json').write_text(json.dumps({'set':'FIT','title':'Tippy Cay moves','format':1,'credit':'Original hand-keyed Wobble Wit clips (CC0); Plank adapted from Mesh2Motion Pushup (CC0).','legend':[],'fps':30,'sources':{},'clips':clips},indent=2))\nPY\npython3 tools/make-text-motion.py\ncat > engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/dialogue.rs <<'EOF'\nuse super::events::Kind;\n#[derive(serde::Deserialize)]struct Bank{pip:Lines,posey:Lines,kettle:Lines,bounce:Lines,gull:Lines,awards:Awards}\n#[derive(serde::Deserialize)]struct Lines{lines:Vec<String>}\n#[derive(serde::Deserialize)]struct Awards{titles:Vec<String>}\nfn bank()->&'static Bank{static DATA:std::sync::OnceLock<Bank>=std::sync::OnceLock::new();DATA.get_or_init(||toml::from_str(include_str\"'!(\"script.toml\")).expect(\"authored resort dialogue\"))}\npub fn pip(day:u8,age:u8,n:usize)->String{if age<=40{format!(\"Balance Age {age}. The rowboat has begun to respect you.\")}else if n%3==0{format!(\"Balance Age {age}. A number with room for improvement.\")}else{let b=&bank().pip.lines;b[((day as usize-1)*16+n%16)%b.len()].clone()}}\npub fn coach(k:Kind,day:u8,n:usize)->String {let b=bank();let lines=match k.coach(){\"POSEY\"=>&b.posey.lines,\"BIG KETTLE\"=>&b.kettle.lines,\"BOUNCE\"=>&b.bounce.lines,\"COMMODORE GULL\"=>&b.gull.lines,_=>&b.pip.lines};lines[(n+day as usize*3)%lines.len()].clone()}\npub fn title(score:u32,variant:usize)->String{let a=&bank().awards.titles;let group=(score/170).min(5)as usize;a[(group*6+variant)%a.len()].clone()}\nEOF\nCARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 cargo check --locked -p pav_core > ../check-core.log 2>&1'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":101,"status":"failed"}}
