{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_40","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\\\\n## Implementation checkpoint\\\\n- Cloned public Pavilion/Sh​ardfall engine and downloaded AI Hub client 1.4.0 plus harness. Native baseline built successfully.\\\\n- Added \"'`games/fit/` with 11 activities, morning check, finale, shared spring, data charts/rules/script, five-day flow, saves, wardrobe, local medley, attract, menu model and bot.'\"\\\\n- Generated 29 original text-format props, nine native resort rooms, 22 FIT animation clips; authored 80 Pip lines, 25 per coach, 36 award titles.\\\\n- Engine changes so far: fit input fields/buttons, frozen Game hook, fit HUD/status, new audio/effect events, figure tilt.\\\\n- Currently wiring UI, audio and browser seams. Core compile and scoring tests are next; functionality has not been certified yet.\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\nPY\nmkdir -p engine/crates/pav_ui/fonts fonts-download\nnpm pack @expo-google-fonts/fredoka --pack-destination fonts-download > fonts-download/fredoka.log 2>&1 && npm pack @expo-google-fonts/nunito --pack-destination fonts-download > fonts-download/nunito.log 2>&1\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport tarfile,pathlib\np=pathlib.Path('fonts-download')\nfor a in p.glob('*.tgz'):\n with tarfile.open(a)as t:\n  for n in t.getmembers():\n   if n.name.endswith(('Fredoka_600SemiBold.ttf','Nunito_700Bold.ttf')):\n    pathlib.Path('engine/crates/pav_ui/fonts',pathlib.Path(n.name).name).write_bytes(t.extractfile(n).read())\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
