assertions v1.1.0\n    Checking winnow v1.0.4\n    Checking either v1.18.0\n    Checking downcast-rs v2.0.2\n    Checking toml_parser v1.1.3+spec-1.1.0\n    Checking profiling v1.0.18\n    Checking zmij v1.0.23\n    Checking toml_datetime v1.1.1+spec-1.1.0\n    Checking half v2.7.1\n    Checking serde_spanned v1.1.1\n    Checking simba v0.10.2\n    Checking ciborium-ll v0.2.2\n    Checking toml_writer v1.1.2+spec-1.1.0\n    Checking memchr v2.8.3\n    Checking itoa v1.0.18\n   Compiling pav_core v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261104-222458__x35112d/work/Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-222458/engine/crates/pav_core)\n    Checking toml v1.1.6+spec-1.1.0\n    Checking serde_json v1.0.151\n    Checking ciborium v0.2.2\n    Checking anyhow v1.0.104\n    Checking nalgebra v0.35.0\n    Checking glamx v0.3.1\n    Checking parry3d v0.31.1\n    Checking rapier3d v0.36.0\ntotal 184K\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  49K Nov  4 22:43 Fredoka_600SemiBold.ttf\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 130K Nov  4 22:43 Nunito_700Bold.ttf\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
