ation':info,'testingFeedback':['unknown','unknown','unknown','unknown'],'engineFeedback':['Deterministic simulation, headless tools and native primitive art share one build.','Integration required reading engine input, frame, audio and app internals.','A shared balance spring, full resort flow, activity rules and controller-first UI.','Connecting a custom game UI and browser inputs across several engine crates.','Added game input fields, frozen-world hook, fit HUD, figure tilt, procedural music/voices and splash effects.','A first-class custom-game shell with menus, saves, controller mapping and browser hooks.'],'promptFeedback':['The concrete daily ritual, event rules and deadpan cast gave the game a clear identity.','The enormous build scope and verification claims still needed local revalidation.','Finishing the full anthology, shell and multiplayer as one deterministic game.','Provide the engine seams as a reusable starting package, then spend more of the brief on play tuning.'],'aiHub':{'name':'Wobble Wit','tagline':'A little less wobble. A little more you.','description':'Win a five-day holiday at a wellness resort staffed by talking gym equipment. Lean, breathe, step and splash through eleven activities, then try doing absolutely nothing.','type':'Game','genre':'Sports','source':'Wii Fit','series':'Wii Fit','players':'1–4','controls':'Left stick/WASD/mouse lean; Cross/Space/click action; shoulders/Q/E steps; Triangle/Tab schedule; Options/Esc pause.','tags':['3d','third-person','comedy','sports','versus','low-poly']}}\npathlib.Path('../exit-interview.json').write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2,ensure_ascii=False))\nPY\npython3 tools/make-page.py\ncat > tools/build.sh <<'EOF'\n#\"'!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")/..\"\npython3 tools/make-page.py\ncd engine\nCARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 scripts/build-web.sh --single-file --scene fit --title \"Wobble Wit — A little less wobble\" --description \"A five-day wellness holiday staffed by talking gym equipment. Eleven activities. One very patient clam.\" --theme-color '\"'#8fdde0' --out ../../Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-222458.html\nEOF\nchmod +x tools/build.sh\n# Shell scripts create temporary bindgen output inside this workspace.\npython3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('engine/scripts/build-web.sh');s=p.read_text().replace('bindgen=\"'$(mktemp -d)'\"','bindgen=\"'$(mktemp -d \"$PWD/target/bindgen.XXXXXX\")'\"');p.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
