ents_sound_and_music_bus_is_ten_percent(){for song in 1..=7{let mut m=Mixer::new(48000.);m.music.set(song);let mut a=vec![0.;96000];m.render(&mut a);assert!(rms(&a)>0.0001,\"song {song}\");}let mut quiet=Mixer::new(48000.);let mut full=Mixer::new(48000.);quiet.music.set(1);full.music.set(1);full.gains[1]=1.;let mut a=vec![0.;48000];let mut b=vec![0.;48000];quiet.render(&mut a);full.render(&mut b);let ratio=rms(&a)/rms(&b);assert!((ratio-0.1).abs()<0.005,\"ratio {ratio}\");}\n}\nEOF\ncat >> notes/decisions.md <<'\"'EOF'\n- Every prop's rounded radius is clamped to its thinnest half extent; native asset schema validation caught invalid radii before packaging.\n- Squat rest periods only earn points after an actual descent; Tray Trek has a readable slow tray drift that requires counterbalance. Both now distinguish active play from idle.\n- Rhythm input anchors to the synthesizer's sample position, rebasing after a track restarts so pausing cannot desynchronise notes.\nEOF\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n- Core app compiles. Every activity passes the 5-seed bot/idle/careless score test after squat/tray tuning.\n- Runtime prop schema checks caught excessive rounded radii after category fix; all generated radii clamped, next full core run underway.\n- First wasm distribution build is compiling dependencies. Browser and Hub suites and README are written.\n- Added sample-clock rhythm anchoring, actual dev view toggles, live input tuning, defensive save load and previous-seat medley ghosts.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
