=p.read_text().replace('    4=>{let base=780.;','''    10=>{c.panel(142.,377.,94.,350.,42.,C::from_rgba_premultiplied(255,255,250,235));c.p.circle_stroke(c.at(189.,685.),31.*s,Stroke::new(5.*s,MINT));c.dot(189.,405.+(1.-u.guide)*280.,17.,CORAL);c.text(106.,753.,\\\"BOUNCE\\\",29.,TEAL,false);},\n    4=>{let base=780.;''');p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> notes/decisions.md <<'EOF'\n- Paddle forward/back lean now changes travel speed, with gate/tip penalties applied to the actual run time. Jog steps change travel pace; crabs and ribbons stay fixed on the route and can be hit/collected.\n- Pose Parade introduces the other three authored poses on later days and in Free Play. The dive has a large low-point timing cue.\nEOF\n./tools/build.sh > build-web.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
