{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_93","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('out.push(item(9,\\\"Reset saved stays\\\".into(),\\\"Opens a confirmation\\\".into()));','if \"'!self.hub.hub{out.push(item(9,\"Reset saved stays\".into(),\"Opens a confirmation\".into()));}'\"')\ns=s.replace('json\"'!({\"title\":TITLE,'\"','let hub_score=if self.hub.ended{self.hub.scores.last().copied().unwrap_or(self.hub.total)}else{self.hub.total+self.event.score};\\\\n        json\"'!({\"title\":TITLE,'\"',1).replace('\\\"hub\\\":{\\\"score\\\":self.hub.total+self.event.score,','\\\"hub\\\":{\\\"score\\\":hub_score,',1)\ns=s.replace('let gains=[self.save.settings.music,self.save.settings.sfx,self.save.settings.voice];','let gains=if self.hub.ended{[0.;3]}else{[self.save.settings.music,self.save.settings.sfx,self.save.settings.voice]};')\ns=s.replace('else if self.screen==Screen::Event||(self.hub.hub&&matches\"'!(self.screen,Screen::Pause|Screen::Settings)){'\"','else if self.screen==Screen::Event{')\nanchor='        if matches\"'!(self.screen,Screen::Look|Screen::Wardrobe)'\"'\ns=s.replace(anchor,'''        if self.hub.hub&&self.hub.go&&\"'!self.hub.ended&&matches!(self.screen,Screen::Pause|Screen::Settings){\n            self.event.step(&InputFrame::default(),dt,&self.rules,events,world::origin(self.set));\n            world::animate(sim,&self.event,&mut self.props,self.set,dt);\n            if self.event.finished{self.hub.total+=self.event.score;self.medley_next(sim);}\n        }\n'\"'''+anchor,1)\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events/mod.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('if i.any||i.held\"'!=0||i.lean.length()>0.1 {self.peace=false;}'\"','if t>0.6&&(i.any||i.held\"'!=0||i.lean.length()>0.1) {self.peace=false;}'\"');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_app/src/input.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('self.fit_device=0;self.fit_any=true;','self.fit_device=0;self.fit_any|=state==ElementState::Pressed;').replace('self.fit_device=2;self.fit_any=true;','self.fit_device=2;self.fit_any|=state==ElementState::Pressed;',1);p.write_text(s)\n# Retain generated source parity for the final art and motion assets.\np=Path('tools/make-art.py');s=p.read_text().replace('(180,22,11,42),(180,19,11,40)','(0,22,11,42),(0,19,11,40)');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('tools/make-text-motion.py');s=p.read_text();needle=\\\"(root/'anim/fit.json').write_text\\\";pos=s.index(needle);s=s[:pos]+'''style=json.loads((root/'anim/style100.json').read_text());tray=copy.deepcopy(style['clips']['Balance_Walk']);tray['clip']='TrayWalk';tray['desc']='Balance walk carrying the smoothie tray.'\nfor key in tray['keys']:key['armL']=[60,20,-50,80,0];key['armR']=[60,20,-50,80,0]\nclips['TrayWalk']=tray\n'''+s[pos:];s=s.replace(\\\"Plank adapted from Mesh2Motion Pushup (CC0).\\\",\\\"Plank adapted from Mesh2Motion Pushup (CC0). TrayWalk adapted from 100STYLE, Mason, Starke and Komura (CC-BY-4.0).\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> engine/crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs <<'EOF'\n\n#[test]fn hub_score_sums_all_events_and_pause_keeps_its_clock(){let mut s=sim(\\\"fit/medley\\\",9);modify(&mut s,|g|{g.hub.go=true;g.screen=Screen::Pause;});let before=game(&s).event.time;for _ in 0..5{s.step(&InputFrame::default());}assert\"'!(game(&s).event.time>before);s.step(&InputFrame{ui:Some(UiEvent::Click(1)),..Default::default()});assert_eq!(game(&s).screen,Screen::Settings);modify(&mut s,|g|{g.hub.ended=true;g.hub.scores=vec![2400];g.hub.total=0;g.event.score=800;});assert_eq!(game(&s).status_json(&s)[\"hub\"][\"score\"],2400);}\nEOF\n# Write all feedback as real questions plus answers in final About data; test values updated after verification.\ncat >> notes/feedback.md <<'\"'EOF'\n- Browser evidence showed fixed-duration 200 ms pad taps could occur entirely during shader/render stalls; updated browser tests to hold until the game acknowledges the input. This was a test pacing limitation in addition to the controller compatibility seam.\n- Code-path verification found the online medley reported only the final event after completion; corrected to the stored total, and added a regression check.\n- Code-path verification found online Pause/Settings were unreachable while the event kept running; split background activity stepping from menu handling and added a regression check.\nEOF\n./tests/run.sh core > notes/core-result.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_94","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('tools/make-page.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"if(navigator.gpu)__fitExternalUi.push({kind:'settings'});\\\",\\\"if(window.__hasWebGPU)__fitExternalUi.push({kind:'settings'});\\\").replace(\\\"if(__touchOnly&&navigator.gpu&&\"'!open)\",\"if(__touchOnly&&window.__hasWebGPU&&!open)\")\ns=s.replace(\" if(!navigator.gpu){msg.replaceChildren();\",\" let hasGPU=false;try{hasGPU=!!(navigator.gpu&&await navigator.gpu.requestAdapter());}catch{}window.__hasWebGPU=hasGPU;'\"\\\\n if(\"'!hasGPU){if(AIHub.active)AIHub.fail('\"'This game needs WebGPU');msg.replaceChildren();\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('Motion libraries: CMU (research motion data), Mesh2Motion and Quaternius (CC0), STYLE100 (see source credit). Full notices in source engine/store/CREDITS.md.','Motion: CMU Graphics Lab (free use, redistribution, no resale); Mesh2Motion and Quaternius (CC0); 100STYLE, Mason, Starke and Komura (CC-BY-4.0). Full notices: engine/store/CREDITS.md.');p.write_text(s)\nPY\n./tools/build.sh > build-web.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_95","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"tail -6 notes/core-result.log; tail -20 notes/test-core.log; tail -6 build-web.log; cat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Current verification and fixes\n- Native baseline + fit app compile, self-contained HTML produced (~11.7 MB). Root HTML exists with the exact required name.\n- Core suite previously 18/18 passed; latest rerun includes a Hub total-score and online-pause regression. Runs take about two minutes, mostly full simulation playthroughs.\n- First browser pass reached keyboard menus but a short simulated controller hold landed during renderer stalls. Debug holds confirmed standard pad Cross works and changes device; paced tests now wait for acknowledgement.\n- Latest build is queued/running with final gameplay corrections: paddle/jog pace affects travel; fixed crabs/ribbons; six poses on later days; dive timing gauge; actual checkout framing; twelve-segment attract loop; controller source/pad polling; Hub total and background menu stepping.\n- Need finish: rerun browser and Hub suites, viewport matrix and inspect PNGs (plus all-set native captures), write accurate final feedback/counts into exit-interview, rebuild plain About block, final one-command tests, delete engine/target + download caches.\n- Test command: dev/tests/run.sh [core|browser|hub|all]. Logs in dev/notes. Build: dev/tools/build.sh. Do not modify neighboring runs or kill shared processes.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
