{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_101","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"head -60 hub/session.js; tail -16 notes/core-result.log; tail -8 build-web.log; python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('tests/browser.py');s=p.read_text().replace('for _ in range(7):','for _ in range(6):');p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n- Latest core run found paddle score was only ~474 after speed was made physical: gate transition scored the next target prematurely. Fixed the just-passed-gate check and buoy positions; this requires one final score/core run.\n- Card composition now offsets the figure into the visible right pane and draws the coach's line; coach card voices use distinct formant speakers. Added both identical Twins on the hub.\n- Code changes are now limited to actual test findings. Remaining verification: paced browser suite, Hub scenarios, viewport fallback checks and final capture gallery, then metadata/build/cache cleanup.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_101","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"head -60 hub/session.js; tail -16 notes/core-result.log; tail -8 build-web.log; python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('tests/browser.py');s=p.read_text().replace('for _ in range(7):','for _ in range(6):');p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n- Latest core run found paddle score was only ~474 after speed was made physical: gate transition scored the next target prematurely. Fixed the just-passed-gate check and buoy positions; this requires one final score/core run.\n- Card composition now offsets the figure into the visible right pane and draws the coach's line; coach card voices use distinct formant speakers. Added both identical Twins on the hub.\n- Code changes are now limited to actual test findings. Remaining verification: paced browser suite, Hub scenarios, viewport fallback checks and final capture gallery, then metadata/build/cache cleanup.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"/*! aihub-session 1.4.0 — AI Hub Session Protocol v1 client. Paste it into your game unmodified. */\n(function (root) {\n  'use strict';\n  if (root.AIHub) return;\n\n  var VERSION = '1.4.0';\n  var HELLO_EVERY_MS = 500;\n  var HELLO_TIMEOUT_MS = 10000;\n  var PROGRESS_EVERY_MS = 1000;\n  /** The hub's welcome may change these; a newer hub never needs a newer copy of this file for it. */\n  var limits = { maxBytes: 16384, ratePerS: 20, burst: 40 };\n\n  var framed = false;\n  try {\n    framed = root.parent && root.parent !== root;\n  } catch (e) {\n    framed = true;\n  }\n  var search = String(root.location && root.location.search);\n  var flagged = /[?&]aihub=/.test(search);\n  var seedArg = /[?&]aihub-seed=(\\d+)/.exec(search);\n\n  var hub = {\n    version: VERSION,\n    protocol: 1,\n    /** True when the hub launched this page for a session (?aihub=1 inside a frame). */\n    active: !!(flagged && framed),\n    me: null,\n    host: null,\n    isHost: false,\n    players: [],\n    mode: null,\n    seed: 0,\n    limitMs: 0,\n    round: 0,\n    /** True when the hub shows the round's splash and collects every player's ready: call ready() once loaded, with no prompt. */\n    splash: false,\n    /** True when the hub seeded Math.random for this round (side by side): every copy draws the same numbers. */\n    seeded: false,\n  };\n\n  /** A storage that lives and dies with the page: the Storage methods, and items as properties too. */\n  function memoryStorage() {\n    var data = Object.create(null);\n    var api = {\n      getItem: function (k) {\n        k = String(k);\n        return k in data ? data[k] : null;\n      },\n      setItem: function (k, v) {\n        data[String(k)] = String(v);\n      },\n      removeItem: function (k) {\n        delete data[String(k)];\n      },\n      clear: function () {\n        for (var k in data) delete data[k];\n      },\n      key: function (i) {\n        var keys = Object.keys(data);\npaddle-slalom seed 2: bot 475, idle 0, careless 0\npaddle-slalom seed 3: bot 474, idle 0, careless 0\npaddle-slalom seed 4: bot 474, idle 0, careless 0\npaddle-slalom seed 5: bot 474, idle 0, careless 0\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\n\n\nfailures:\n    every_bot_beats_idle_and_careless\n\ntest result: FAILED. 10 passed; 1 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 100.57s\n\n\nerror: test failed, to rerun pass `-p pav_core --test fit`\n\n18 passed, 1 failed\n    Blocking waiting for file lock on package cache\n    Blocking waiting for file lock on package cache\n    Blocking waiting for file lock on package cache\n   Compiling pav_core v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261104-222458__x35112d/work/Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-222458/engine/crates/pav_core)\n   Compiling pav_view v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261104-222458__x35112d/work/Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt