{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_102","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('self.event.record_at+=0.1;','self.event.record_at+=0.25;');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/world.rs');s=p.read_text();old='if let Some(p)=e.best_ghost.iter().find(|p|p.t>=t){sim.set_position(id,o+p.pos+Vec3::X*3.);';new='''if let Some(p)=e.best_ghost.get(e.best_ghost.partition_point(|p|p.t<t)){let index=e.best_ghost.partition_point(|p|p.t<t);let previous=e.best_ghost.get(index.saturating_sub(1)).unwrap_or(p);let blend=((t-previous.t)/(p.t-previous.t).max(0.001)).clamp(0.,1.);sim.set_position(id,o+previous.pos.lerp(p.pos,blend)+Vec3::X*3.);''';assert old in s;s=s.replace(old,new);p.write_text(s)\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('assert_eq\"'!(g.screen,Screen::Credits);'\"','assert_eq\"'!(g.screen,Screen::Credits);assert!(serde_json::to_string(&g.save).unwrap().len()<600_000,\"four guest saves must fit localStorage\");'\"',1);p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> notes/decisions.md <<'EOF'\n- Saved ghosts sample at 4 Hz and interpolate positions. This keeps four complete guest slots within ordinary localStorage quotas; the full-stay test enforces a 600 KB per-slot budget.\nEOF\ncd engine\ncargo fmt --all\nCARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 cargo build --locked -p pav_tools --bin pav > ../build-native.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
