{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_115","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > tools/capture-gallery.py <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport subprocess,json\nroot=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1];engine=root/'engine';out=root/'out';out.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\nscenes=[('title','fit',1),('island','fit/hub',1),('breath','fit/event/breath-bloom',240),('pose','fit/event/pose-parade',240),('squat','fit/event/tempo-squats',90),('plank','fit/event/plank-standoff',240),('step','fit/event/step-party',240),('floatie','fit/event/floatie-spin',600),('lap','fit/event/morning-lap',600),('tide','fit/event/tide-table',360),('paddle','fit/event/paddle-slalom',600),('tray','fit/event/tray-trek',600),('dive','fit/event/cannonball-cup',480),('finale','fit/event/big-stand',240)]\nfor name,scene,ticks in scenes:\n commands=f'load scene={scene}\\\\nplay bot=true ticks={ticks}\\\\ncapture width=1920 height=1080 out={out/name}.png\\\\n'\n r=subprocess.run([str(engine/'target/debug/pav'),'repl'],input=commands,text=True,capture_output=True,cwd=engine)\n (root/'notes'/f'capture-{name}.log').write_text(r.stdout+r.stderr)\n if r.returncode:raise RuntimeError(f'{name}: {r.stderr[-500:]}')\n(out/'index.html').write_text('<\"'!doctype html><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Wobble Wit · captures</title><style>body{background:#e6f1ec;font:20px system-ui;color:#263e54;margin:40px}img{max-width:100%;display:block;border-radius:20px}figure{margin:40px 0}</style><h1>Wobble Wit · native 1080p captures</h1>'\"'+''.join(f'<figure><figcaption>{name}</figcaption><img src=\\\"{name}.png\\\" alt=\\\"{name}\\\"></figure>'for name,_,_in scenes))\nprint(f'{len(scenes)} native captures')\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('tools/capture-gallery.py');s=p.read_text().replace('for name,_,_in scenes','for name,_,_ in scenes');p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Final verification underway\n- Current HTML: 11.7 MB, entirely embedded. Source formatted with cargo fmt.\n- Final build + tests/run.sh all is running (exec session 1334), after native build session 92215. Tests now include Escape routing, online medley totals/pause, mouse interaction distance, and save-size bounds.\n- Mouse/furniture interaction and dive side-view geometry were the last fixes. Balance nudges are deterministic and shared by all events. No planned feature is left as a stub.\n- Browser-stage.txt now records the last successful browser check. Read notes/final-tests.log and notes/test-*.log for results.\n- Capture tool ready: tools/capture-gallery.py (run after native build), outputs all sets/events at 1080p to dev/out; inspect PNGs.\n- Then run viewport-matrix on the file URL with phone/tablet/wide screens and WebKit, inspect PNGs; record limitations (WebKit fallback, no physical TV/pad/iOS).\n- Update exit-interview.json (root) with accurate counts and answers, regenerate HTML About data via tools/build.sh, validate final package; remove engine/target, fonts-download and transient staging caches. Keep sources, tests and evidence.\nEOF\npython3 -m py_compile tools/capture-gallery.py tests/browser.py tests/hub.py tests/run.py tools/make-page.py\nls -lh ../*.html\ncat notes/browser-stage.txt 2>/dev/null\nhead -5 notes/final-tests.log 2>/dev/null\ntail -7 build-native.log\ntail -7 build-web.log\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
