{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_129","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '18,55p' engine/crates/pav_ui/src/fit_ui.rs; cat notes/test-browser.log; ls notes/hub*.json; tail -7 notes/final-tests.log; tail -4 build-native.log; tail -4 build-web.log\"","aggregated_output":"    f.font_data.insert(\n        \"Fredoka\".into(),\n        std::sync::Arc::new(egui::FontData::from_static(include_bytes!(\"../fonts/Fredoka_600SemiBold.ttf\"))),\n    );\n    f.font_data\n        .insert(\"Nunito\".into(), std::sync::Arc::new(egui::FontData::from_static(include_bytes!(\"../fonts/Nunito_700Bold.ttf\"))));\n    f.families.insert(FontFamily::Name(\"title\".into()), vec![\"Fredoka\".into()]);\n    f.families.insert(FontFamily::Name(\"body\".into()), vec![\"Nunito\".into()]);\n    ctx.set_fonts(f);\n}\nstruct Canvas {\n    p: egui::Painter,\n    s: f32,\n    o: Vec2,\n}\nimpl Canvas {\n    fn at(&self, x: f32, y: f32) -> Pos2 {\n        Pos2::new(self.o.x + x * self.s, self.o.y + y * self.s)\n    }\n    fn rect(&self, x: f32, y: f32, w: f32, h: f32) -> Rect {\n        Rect::from_min_size(self.at(x, y), Vec2::new(w, h) * self.s)\n    }\n    fn panel(&self, x: f32, y: f32, w: f32, h: f32, r: f32, c: C) {\n        self.p.rect_filled(self.rect(x, y, w, h), CornerRadius::same((r * self.s).max(1.) as u8), c);\n    }\n    fn border(&self, x: f32, y: f32, w: f32, h: f32, r: f32, c: C, weight: f32) {\n        self.p.rect_stroke(\n            self.rect(x, y, w, h),\n            CornerRadius::same((r * self.s).max(1.) as u8),\n            Stroke::new(weight * self.s, c),\n            StrokeKind::Inside,\n        );\n    }\n    fn text(&self, x: f32, y: f32, t: &str, size: f32, c: C, title: bool) {\n        self.p.text(\n            self.at(x, y),\n            Align2::LEFT_TOP,\n            t,\nFAIL music starts at ten percent\n30 passed, 1 failed\nnotes/hub-2.json\nnotes/hub-3-leave.json\nnotes/hub-3.json\nnotes/hub-4.json\nFAIL browser:\nFAIL music starts at ten percent\n30 passed, 1 failed\n\n\n57 passed, 1 failed\n   Compiling pav_audio v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261104-222458__x35112d/work/Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-222458/engine/crates/pav_audio)\n   Compiling pav_view v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261104-222458__x35112d/work/Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-222458/engine/crates/pav_view)\n   Compiling pav_tools v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261104-222458__x35112d/work/Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-222458/engine/crates/pav_tools)\n    Finished `dev` profile [optimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 1m 50s\n   Compiling pav_tools v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261104-222458__x35112d/work/Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-222458/engine/crates/pav_tools)\n   Compiling pav_app v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261104-222458__x35112d/work/Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-222458/engine/crates/pav_app)\n    Finished `dist` profile [optimized] target(s) in 1m 46s\n/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261104-222458__x35112d/work/Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-222458/engine/../../Wobble-Wit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-222458.html: 11.7 MB (wasm 29.1 MB, gzipped 8.7 MB; JS glue 0.1 MB)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_130","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_ui/src/fit_ui.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('''    f.families.insert(FontFamily::Name(\\\"title\\\".into()), vec\"'![\"Fredoka\".into()]);\n    f.families.insert(FontFamily::Name(\"body\".into()), vec![\"Nunito\".into()]);'\"''','''    let fallback=f.families.get(&FontFamily::Proportional).cloned().unwrap_or_default();\n    let mut title=vec\"'![\"Fredoka\".into()];title.extend(fallback.clone());\n    let mut body=vec![\"Nunito\".into()];body.extend(fallback);\n    f.families.insert(FontFamily::Name(\"title\".into()), title);\n    f.families.insert(FontFamily::Name(\"body\".into()), body);'\"''');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('tests/browser.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"status(p)['settings']['music']==.1\\\",\\\"abs(status(p)['settings']['music']-.1)<.00001\\\");p.write_text(s)\np=Path('tools/capture-gallery.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"('title','fit',1),('island','fit/hub',1)\\\",\\\"('title','fit',0),('island','fit/hub',0)\\\").replace(\\\"commands=f'load scene={scene}\\\\\\\\nplay bot=true ticks={ticks}\\\\\\\\ncapture width=1920 height=1080 out={out/name}.png\\\\\\\\n'\\\",\\\"play=f'play bot=true ticks={ticks}' if ticks else 'step ticks=1'\\\\n commands=f'load scene={scene}\\\\\\\\n{play}\\\\\\\\ncapture width=1920 height=1080 out={out/name}.png\\\\\\\\n'\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> notes/feedback.md <<'EOF'\n- Native capture review: Nunito lacked the up/down arrow glyphs; added the engine's default font fallback after the rounded fonts.\n- The remaining browser failure used exact Python float equality against an f32 serialised through JSON; replaced with tolerance. The music value itself and the offline 10% gain check were correct.\nEOF\ncd engine\ncargo fmt --all\nCARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 cargo build --locked -p pav_tools --bin pav > ../build-native.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_c