{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_147","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> engine/crates/pav_app/src/weblink.rs <<'EOF'\n\n/// The Hub owns the pre-round card. Publish loaded sim state before the first expensive\n/// background draw, then reserve rendering for the round itself.\n#[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\npub fn waiting_for_round() -> bool {\n    let hub=get(&win(),\\\"__hub\\\");\n    \"'!hub.is_undefined()&&!hub.is_null()&&!get(&hub,\"go\").as_bool().unwrap_or(false)&&!get(&hub,\"ended\").as_bool().unwrap_or(false)\n}\n#[cfg(not(target_arch = \"wasm32\"))]\npub fn waiting_for_round() -> bool {false}\nEOF\npython3 - <<'\"'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('        let (prev, curr) = crate::weblink::ghosts(prev, curr);','        if curr.hud.fit.as_ref().is_some_and(|f|f.hub)&&crate::weblink::waiting_for_round(){return;}\\\\n        let (prev, curr) = crate::weblink::ghosts(prev, curr);',1);p.write_text(s)\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_view/src/fx.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('        E::Splash { pos } => out.push(with(\\\"fountain\\\",','''        E::Wake {pos}=>out.push(with(\\\"fountain\\\",*pos+Vec3::Y*0.03,5,&|b|{b.vel=Vec3::Y*0.15;b.spread=0.18;b.size=(0.06,0.015);b.life=(0.3,0.6);b.floor=None;b.color0=Vec4::new(0.9,1.,1.1,0.7);})),\n        E::Splash { pos } => out.push(with(\\\"fountain\\\",''',1);p.write_text(s)\np=Path('../exit-interview.json');d=json.loads(p.read_text());d['testingFeedback'][0]=d['testingFeedback'][0].replace('15 distinct','16 distinct');p.write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n')\np=Path('notes/feedback.md');s=p.read_text().replace('15 distinct game/UI','16 distinct game/UI').replace('Test harness corrections:','16. Four-player startup could miss ready by two seconds while software-rendering the covered pre-round scene. Loaded sim state now reaches the Hub before background drawing; drawing starts with the round.\\\\n\\\\nTest harness corrections:');p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> notes/decisions.md <<'EOF'\n- While the Hub's own pre-round card is up, publish loaded simulation status and defer scene drawing until the round starts. This keeps four software-rendered copies from delaying readiness.\n- Wake events also emit small silent foam particles, so the paddle trail reads on the native flat pastel sea.\nEOF\ncd engine\ncargo fmt --all\ncd ..\n./tools/build.sh > build-web.log 2>&1 && ./tests/run.sh all > notes/final-tests.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
